                                                                <div class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
                        <button class="accordion-item__header margin-trim" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="offers-item">
                            <h4 class="accordion-item__heading">
                                Ways to save
                            </h4>
                            <span class="accordion-item__icon btn btn--mask-icon btn--square" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        </button>

                        <div class="accordion-item__content-panel" id="offers-item" aria-hidden="true" data-accordion-content>
                            <div class="accordion-item__content">
                                                                    <div class="type-body-xs">
                                        <p><strong>Become a Park Keeper<br />
</strong>Save 15% on up to eight tickets during your membership. From just £60 per year. <a href="https://parktheatre.co.uk/support-us/become-a-park-keeper/">Read more</a></p>
<p><strong>Access</strong><br />
Tickets £18.50 to Access members. <a href="https://parktheatre.co.uk/visit-eat-and-drink/accessibility/">Read more</a></p>
<p><strong>Park Under 30</strong><br />
Tickets £10 (available on PINK &amp; YELLOW seats for all performances). <a href="https://parktheatre.co.uk/visit-eat-and-drink/park-under-30/">Read more</a></p>
<p><strong>65+</strong><br />
Selected seats on Monday evenings and Thursday matinees. <a href="https://parktheatre.co.uk/visit-eat-and-drink/tickets-and-booking/">Read more</a></p>
<p><strong>Live in an N postcode?</strong><br />
Discounts are available for our local N postcode residents on Tuesday performances. <a href="https://parktheatre.co.uk/visit-eat-and-drink/tickets-and-booking/">Read more</a></p>
<p><strong>Pay what you can</strong><br />
We have a limited number of pay what you can tickets available to those on low incomes, for Thursday matinee or Wednesday evening performances. <a href="https://parktheatre.co.uk/visit-eat-and-drink/tickets-and-booking/">Read more</a></p>
<p><strong>Entertainment Union Members</strong><br />
Discounts are available Monday – Thursday. <a href="https://parktheatre.co.uk/visit-eat-and-drink/tickets-and-booking/">Read more</a></p>
<p><strong>Groups</strong><br />
Buy 10 tickets and get the 11th ticket free. Discount automatically applies in the basket.</p>

                                    </div>
                                                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                                    
                                            <div class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
                    <button class="accordion-item__header margin-trim" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="your-visit-item">
                        <h4 class="accordion-item__heading">
                            Your visit
                        </h4>
                        <span class="accordion-item__icon btn btn--mask-icon btn--square" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </button>

                    <div class="accordion-item__content-panel" id="your-visit-item" aria-hidden="true" data-accordion-content>
