                                                    <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                                        <h2>Elzbieta Kalicka </h2>

                                                                                                                    <h4>Regina</h4>
                                                                                                            </div>

                                                    <div class="person-dialog__bio">
                                                        <p class="type-body-xl"></p>

                                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio__main__text">
                                                            <p>Elzbieta trained at Wac Arts, acquiring a Diploma in Professional Musical Theatre.</p>
<p>Theatre credits include: THE BEAR WHO WENT TO WAR (Albany Theatre); THE MOZART QUESTION, THE BROTHERS GRIMM PRESENT: CINDERELLA (The Barn Theatre, Cirencester); and JEANNE THE MUSICAL (The Turbine Theatre), in which she played Joan of Arc.</p>
<p>Training credits include: Mac the Knife in THE THREEPENNY OPERA, DNA, and BERNARDA ALBA.</p>

