                                                <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                                    <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                                        <h2>Oliver Magor</h2>

                                                                                                                    <h4>Ensemble</h4>
                                                                                                            </div>

                                                    <div class="person-dialog__bio">
                                                        <p class="type-body-xl"></p>

                                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio__main__text">
                                                            <p>Oliver is an actor and multi-instrumentalist. He trained at the Mountview Academy of Theatre Arts.</p>
<p>Theatre credits include: THE LION, THE WITCH AND THE WARDROBE (UK &amp; Ireland Tour, Leeds Playhouse); and THE PIED PIPER AND THE SECRET GARDEN (Regent&#8217;s Park Music Festival).</p>
<p>Television credits include: THE BIG NIGHT OF MUSICALS (BBC).</p>

                                                        </div>
