                                                <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                                    <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                                        <h2>Max Roll</h2>

                                                                                                                    <h4>Gimpel/Majorek</h4>
                                                                                                            </div>

                                                    <div class="person-dialog__bio">
                                                        <p class="type-body-xl"></p>

                                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio__main__text">
                                                            <p>Max is a British-born actor who resides in New York.</p>
<p>Theatre credits include: THE HILLS OF CALIFORNIA, AN ENEMY OF THE PEOPLE, GOOD NIGHT, OSCAR (Broadway); GOOD NIGHT, OSCAR (Barbican, West End); GOOD NIGHT, OSCAR (Regional Premiere); MRS. WARREN&#8217;S PROFESSION (Off-Broadway); THE IMPORTANCE OF BEING EARNEST (Regional); 2 PIANOS 4 HANDS (Canada); and MUCH ADO ABOUT NOTHING, TWELFTH NIGHT, THE GREAT GATSBY (UK).</p>
<p>Max is also the narrator of multiple audiobooks. He is husband to TC and cat dad to Munchie.</p>

                                                        </div>
