                                                <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                                    <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                                        <h2>Erin Rowlatt</h2>

                                                                                                                    <h4>Ensemble</h4>
                                                                                                            </div>

                                                    <div class="person-dialog__bio">
                                                        <p class="type-body-xl"></p>

                                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio__main__text">
                                                            <p>Erin trained at Guildford School of Acting, where she was the recipient of the Bice Bellairs Award.</p>
<p>Theatre credits while training include: OUR TOWN, ALICE BY HEART, and THE CURIOUS INCIDENT OF THE DOG IN THE NIGHT-TIME (GSA); and BABIES (BYMT).</p>
<p>Workshop credits include: FUN AT THE BEACH, ROMP-BOMP-A-LOMP, OLIVIER PLAZA, and THE CURIOUS CASE OF BENJAMIN BUTTON.</p>
<p>Film credits include: ACT LIKE A FRIEND (TfL).</p>
<p>Erin is delighted to be making her professional theatre debut in THE PIANIST, and would like to thank her family for their wonderful support.</p>

                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </article>
                                        </template>
                                    
                                    


