                                                                            <template data-dialog-content="dialog-person-cast-and-creatives-6adca65e4813c">
                                            <article class="person-dialog">
                                                <div class="person-dialog__image">
                                                    

                                                                                                            <ul role="list" class="social-links" aria-label="Social media links">
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </ul>
                                                                                                    </div>


                                                <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                                    <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                                        <h2>Simon Lee </h2>

                                                                                                                    <h4>Arrangements, Musical Supervision & Orchestrations</h4>
                                                                                                            </div>

                                                    <div class="person-dialog__bio">
                                                        <p class="type-body-xl"></p>

                                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio__main__text">
                                                            <p><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">Simon Lee did his first West End show in 1982 at the age of 18 as a way to earn money to pay for private piano lessons, having left the RNCM early… If you’re reading this, then you’ll surmise that Simon isn’t a concert pianist! However, he is still enjoying a blessed career as a conductor and music supervisor in Musical Theatre, 44 years later. </span></p>
<p>Theatre highlights include JESUS CHRIST SUPERSTAR, JOSEPH AND THE AMAZING TECHNICOLOR DREAMCOAT, THE SOUND OF MUSIC, WOMAN IN WHITE, EVITA, LOVE NEVER DIES, NOTRE DAME DE PARIS, THE BEAUTIFUL GAME, TELL ME ON A SUNDAY, ON THE TOWN, and WEST SIDE STORY. He currently supervises PHANTOM OF THE OPERA.</p>
<p>Credits as a conductor include many concerts (including a world tour with Bjork), over 50 albums, and films including PHANTOM OF THE OPERA and CATS in both versions!</p>

                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </article>
                                        </template>
                                    
                                    


