                                                                            <template data-dialog-content="dialog-person-cast-and-creatives-6adca65e48166">
                                            <article class="person-dialog">
                                                <div class="person-dialog__image">
                                                    

                                                                                                            <ul role="list" class="social-links" aria-label="Social media links">
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </ul>
                                                                                                    </div>


                                                <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                                    <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                                        <h2>Karen Bruce</h2>

                                                                                                                    <h4>Choreographer & Movement Director  </h4>
                                                                                                            </div>

                                                    <div class="person-dialog__bio">
                                                        <p class="type-body-xl"></p>

                                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio__main__text">
                                                            <p><span data-contrast="auto">Karen is an Olivier Award-winning Choreographer and Director, working extensively in theatre and television both in the UK and abroad. Most recently, Karen choreographed Disney’s REMEMBER, CHITTY CHITTY BANG BANG (Uk tour); THE DRIFTERS GIRL (Garrick Theatre/UK tour). </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Director credits include: SPOTLIGHT BAR, STAGE STRUCK (Princess Cruises); THE LAST TANGO (UK tour, Phoenix Theatre); DANCE ‘TIL DAWN (UK tour, Aldwych Theatre); MIDNIGHT TANGO (UK tour, Phoenix Theatre); STRICTLY COME DANCING &#8211; THE PROFESSIONALS (Stage Entertainment tour); LOVE ME TENDER (UK tour); SATURDAY NIGHT FEVER (Spain, South Africa, Victoria Apollo, UK tour, Australia, Singapore, Scandinavia, Korea); OLIVER! (Gilbert and Sullivan Society of Bermuda); FOOTLOOSE (Novello Theatre, UK tour, South Africa) and </span><i><span data-contrast="auto">The Wedding Singer</span></i><span data-contrast="auto"> (UK tour).</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Choreographer credits include:</span> <span data-contrast="auto">nine seasons at THE LONDON PALLADIUM PANTO; THE LAST TANGO (UK tour, Phoenix Theatre); THE BODYGUARD (UK tour); DANCE TIL’ DAWN (UK tour); STARLIGHT EXPRESS (Joburg Theatre, South Africa); THE LAST HORSEMAN (Madrid); CHESS (Margitszigeti Open Air Theatre, Budapest); NEVER FORGET (Savoy Theatre, UK tour); DOCTOR DOLITTLE (UK tour); PACIFIC OVERTURES (Donmar Warehouse); THE PRODUCERS (Spain); FAR PAVILIONS (Shaftesbury Theatre); BRIGHTON ROCK (Almeida Theatre); ANNIE GET YOUR GUN (number one tour); FOOTLOOSE (Theatre Royal, Plymouth, number one tour); A CHORUS LINE, SWEET CHARITY (Crucible Theatre, Sheffield). </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Television credits include: STRICTLY COME DANCING (BBC, seven seasons), SO YOU THINK YOU CAN DANCE (BBC, two seasons), ANT &amp; DEC’S SATURDAY NIGHT TAKEAWAY (ITV, four seasons), TUMBLE (BBC), TOAST (BBC Film), CHILDREN IN NEED (BBC), ‘BELIEVE IN ME’ (the UK entry in The Eurovision Song Contest 2013), THE VOICE and WALKING THE DEAD. </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Other credits include: 2002 COMMONWEALTH GAMES OPENING CEREMONY  (Manchester), Workshop based on music in war (National Theatre) and several commissions for Princess Cruises and Crystal Cruises.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Karen’s awards and nominations include:</span> <span data-contrast="auto">DANCE ‘TIL DAWN (Best Family and Entertainment Olivier Award Nomination, Aldwych Theatre), PACIFIC OVERTURES (Best Choreography Olivier Award Winner, Donmar Warehouse), SWEET CHARITY (TMA Best Musical Award Winner, Sheffield Crucible), MIDNIGHT TANGO (Best Entertainment Olivier Award nomination); and WhatsOnStage Theatregoers’ Choice nomination for Best Choreographer for NEVER FORGET.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>

                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </article>
                                        </template>
                                    
                                    


