                                                                            <template data-dialog-content="dialog-person-cast-and-creatives-6adca65e4818a">
                                            <article class="person-dialog">
                                                <div class="person-dialog__image">
                                                    

                                                                                                            <ul role="list" class="social-links" aria-label="Social media links">
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </ul>
                                                                                                    </div>


                                                <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                                    <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                                        <h2>Andrzej Goudling </h2>

                                                                                                                    <h4>Set and Video Designer </h4>
                                                                                                            </div>

                                                    <div class="person-dialog__bio">
                                                        <p class="type-body-xl"></p>

                                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio__main__text">
                                                            <p><span data-contrast="auto">Andrzej is an award-winning Set and Video Designer who has worked extensively in the UK</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}"> </span><span data-contrast="auto">and internationally, across many forms of live performance.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Set Design Credits Include: LOST ATOMS, THE UNRETURNING (Frantic Assembly); FOOTBALLERS’ WIVES (Edinburgh); INDIGO (Leicester Curve); CONSTELLATIONS (NCPA); SANE NEW WORLD: RUBY WAX (UK Tour); UNION (Lyceum, Edinburgh). </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Video Design Credits Include: ATONMENT, 8 HOTELS, THE BOY IN THE STRIPED PYJAMAS (Chichester); KISS OF THE SPIDER, WOMAN, MURIEL’S WEDDING (Leicester Curve); WOMAN IN MIND, BORN WITH TEETH (West End); STARLIGHT EXPRESS (Troubadour Wembley Park Theatre); JUST FOR ONE DAY (The Old Vic/West End); 42 BALLOONS (The Lowry, Chicago Shakespeare Theatre); PEOPLE, PLACES AND THINGS (National Theatre, West End, St Ann’s Warehouse); THE UNFRIEND (West End); PRESSURE (West End, UK Tour, Toronto); GROUNDHOG DAY (Broadway, Old Vic); &amp;JULIET (Broadway, West End, Australia); MISS SAIGON (Sheffield Crucible); SYLVIA, EUREKA DAY, SPEED THE PLOW (The Old Vic); THE TIME TRAVELLER’S WIFE (West End); MESSAGE IN A BOTTLE (West End, World Tour); LIFE OF PI (Broadway, West End, World Tour); BURN (EIF); THE DA VINCI CODE (UK Tour); THE DRIFTERS GIRLS (West End, UK Tour); ROOM (Stratford East, Toronto, Broadway); CORIOLANUS, HENRY V (Donmar Warehouse, NT Live); THE UNRETURNING (UK Tour). </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Andrzej has received many awards nominations including wins for; Tony Award, Olivier</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Award, Drama Desk Award, Outer Critics Circle Award, UK Theatre Award, Broadway World</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Award, 2 x WOS Awards, Theatre and Technology Award.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}"> </span></p>

                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </article>
                                        </template>
                                    
                                    


