                                                                            <template data-dialog-content="dialog-person-cast-and-creatives-6adca65e4820f">
                                            <article class="person-dialog">
                                                <div class="person-dialog__image">
                                                    

                                                                                                            <ul role="list" class="social-links" aria-label="Social media links">
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </ul>
                                                                                                    </div>


                                                <div class="person-dialog__content">
                                                    <div class="person-dialog__header margin-trim">
                                                        <h2>Josh Whatsize</h2>

                                                                                                                    <h4>Assistant Director </h4>
                                                                                                            </div>

                                                    <div class="person-dialog__bio">
                                                        <p class="type-body-xl"></p>

                                                        <div class="person-dialog__bio__main__text">
                                                            <p>Josh is a theatre director, producer and practitioner.</p>
<p>The Pianist is the third project where Josh has worked alongside Thom Southerland. As Associate Director, Josh has worked on To Maury with Love (2026) at Theatre Royal Drury Lane and Remember (2026) a new musical with Disney Live Entertainment.</p>
<p>Assistant Director credits include Sochi (Hope Theatre); Hamlet (Petersfield Shakespeare Festival); The Lightning Thief: The Percy Jackson Musical (Mayflower Theatre).</p>
<p>Director credits include The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe (Corn Exchange Newbury); Crusaders (The Kings Theatre Portsmouth); Chaos (The Egg Theatre Bath); The Ramayana Reset (Mayflower Studios &amp; Dorfman Theatre); Antigone (Mayflower Studios) and the Home Theatre project (Southampton).</p>
<p>Josh has held roles across in regional theatres in the South, and from 2023 to 2025 led the PROPEL Artist Development programme at Mayflower Theatre &amp; Studios, supporting artists and companies in developing new work across a range of artforms.</p>
<p>Josh’s latest producer credit is the pilot tour of Liz Garland’s Becoming Simone (2026) which toured along the South Coast. Josh also sits on the Board of Trustees for Corn Exchange Newbury and 101 Outdoor Arts.</p>

                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </article>
                                        </template>
                                    
                                    


